          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okwafika kuye izwi likaJehova ezinsukwini zikaJosiya, indodana ka-Amoni, inkosi yakwaJuda, ngomnyaka weshumi nantathu wokubusa kwakhe.",
          "type": "text",
