          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba bhekani, ngibiza zonke izizukulwane zemibuso yasenyakatho,” usho uJehova; ziyofika zimise yilowo nalowo isihlalo salo sobukhosi ekungeneni kwamasango eJerusalema nakuzo zonke izindonga zalo nxazonke naphezu kwayo yonke imizi yakwaJuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
